{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "a388ace00d4985e31f19f590bea3a1867432220b6a095228b812c04bdfebb719", "ja": "オトナ女子に贈る『Dolce Vita TV』", "zh": "献给成熟女性的《Dolce Vita TV》", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "99741327a7a97c30ed27b1e5bf38ac67134330ca8e02a5019982df38f6f26e2a", "ja": "全てのオトナ女子に向けてお届けする\n特別番組『Dolce Vita TV』！\n4 Luxuryが高級ホテルの一室から\nラグジュアリーな時間をご案内します♪", "zh": "面向所有成熟女性播出的\n特别节目《Dolce Vita TV》！\n4 Luxury将从高级酒店的房间里\n为您带来奢华时光♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1000_039kon", "source_sha256": "aff669e89b1c89b5fd336f36f7cb00d6163bb196e676228c0b435681fbf2efc1", "ja": "すべてのオトナ女子にお届けする特別番組！\n『4 Luxury』の……", "zh": "献给所有成熟女性的特别节目！《4 Luxury》的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "956b4945f78bcf6ca4575850de5731be609f1077dbe7e7ff15ea4410f6457f91", "ja": "始まりました！　オトナ女子による\nオトナ女子のための特別番組『Dolce Vita TV』！", "zh": "开播啦！由成熟女性倾情打造，\n献给所有成熟女性的特别节目《Dolce Vita TV》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "a28602c5caeaafa5122ca668bda5566ba262944d4f0cc9310d693d9fffa70524", "ja": "みんな、元気かしら？\n『4 Luxury』、アダルティ担当の馬場このみよ！", "zh": "大家过得好吗？\n我是“4 Luxury”的性感成熟担当，马场木实哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "376efa0fe87e57e173df8bb3392bc7c192ab7c25cc9a65229f636fe0cac341d5", "ja": "え？　担当なんて打ち合わせになかったですよね？\nああ！？　えーっと……せ、清楚担当の豊川風花です！", "zh": "诶？之前的商量里，没说过要负责什么吧？\n啊！？那个……我、我是负责清纯形象的丰川风花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "1b24c2129615d8b48565d5a555d38851773ee3574171ae43c95b6acb45524a8b", "ja": "私の担当は……歌のお姉さんにしておこうかしら？\n『4 Luxury』の桜守歌織です。ふふっ。", "zh": "我的担当……就定为歌唱姐姐怎么样？\n我是『4 Luxury』的樱守歌织。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "e36cd8f30c2a1e8414e6bb2b47041e5b212c3dc7e395187656f792d56b7622a1", "ja": "はーい！　趣味は登山、肺活担当の北上麗花です！\nここ、すっごく見晴らしがいいですね！　やっほ～♪", "zh": "好——！兴趣是登山，负责肺活量的北上丽花！\n这里的视野真是棒极了！呀吼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "5071a3050019a93a92110c07ff01bb2c289cdb94f4f7efa73c2a1b2826ef3339", "ja": "麗花ちゃんは今日も元気いっぱいね。\nねえ、みんなは『Dolce Vita』って意味知ってる？", "zh": "丽花今天也活力满满呢。\n对了，大家知道“Dolce Vita”是什么意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f9c95a4989fdc611cd607d60e60c856c1fd45a333d5d600600c476c5dd7c3aff", "ja": "私、知ってますよ！　気になって調べてみたんです。\n「甘い生活」「気ままに生きよう」って意味ですよね。", "zh": "我知道哦！因为很好奇就去查了一下。\n是\"甜蜜的生活\"\"随心所欲地活着\"的意思吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "b57543bd6221886e19102cd484b9dabffd8a0634902889f96f4d71c3cedbc8dc", "ja": "大正解～♪　何かと忙しい世の中だけど、\nたまには自分のペースで生きる時間も大切じゃない？", "zh": "完全正确～♪　虽然世道总是忙忙碌碌的，\n但偶尔放慢脚步、按自己的节奏生活也很重要不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "a5ee5348682bf053ee9d5bdaa592ad87943b66910519686cfd1d3589dc187c51", "ja": "この番組で、少しでも素敵な時間が過ごせるように、\n私たちで頑張ってナビゲートしていきましょう♪", "zh": "希望大家能在这个节目里度过哪怕一小段美好时光，就让我们一起努力，为大家指引方向吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "72b007b1c377979da8c96044c4455677f20fe5a9720365c90e20c4ebf213c82a", "ja": "素敵といえば……私たちがいるこの部屋も。\nインテリアも家具も、とってもオシャレで。", "zh": "说到漂亮……我们所在的这个房间也是。室内装饰和家具都特别时髦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "862f4a0475637d068bf22f24d46f4e6ebe90d05b9093974a008d55181960433d", "ja": "ええ。高級ホテルのスイートルームって、憧れの場所\nだったけど、実際に来てみると圧倒されちゃうわね。", "zh": "是啊。高级酒店的套房，原本是我向往的地方，可真正来到这里，还是会让人感到震撼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8ae256c04ddae1088e406b6009d881792e0af0a378371a298c03b0bda22ab048", "ja": "そうですね。手の届かない場所だって思っちゃいます。\nだからこそ、今日はたくさん楽しみたいですね♪", "zh": "是啊。会觉得那是遥不可及的地方。正因如此，今天更要好好享受一番呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "f3c7027443831f3ce5419299958d0378e3ee3f763dd3e32e81906e6e591b7ec3", "ja": "その意気よ、風花ちゃん！\nそういえば、さっきから麗花ちゃんが静かだけど……。", "zh": "就是这个劲头，风花！\n话说回来，丽花从刚才起就一直很安静……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "fb4b1c175859a1de5e5d102acfc9a4eac3695e10a9c30162bddf016d6c846e42", "ja": "？？　私のこと呼びました？\nこのカルパッチョ、すっごく美味しいですよ♪", "zh": "？？你是在叫我吗？\n这个意式生拌鱼片，特别好吃哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "a303fc88dbb43fdaa000bc822580155689ebd2d319fd8cf477001f3eeeaaa1f9", "ja": "ああっ！　もう、先に食べてたのね……。\nちょっと早いけど、私たちも食べましょうか。", "zh": "啊！已经先吃上了啊……  \n虽然还早了点，我们也吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c381948d48f2878fcae983beb67427f586462e89abe9fe9707d6d67d4b88c40f", "ja": "わあ～。さすが高級ホテル、お料理も高級ですね。\nどのお皿もキラキラしてて……あ、こっちは何かな？", "zh": "哇～。真不愧是高级酒店，菜品也这么高档呢。\n每道菜都闪闪发亮的……啊，这边的是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "81ee3794c14fa149d34483ea35c225f08323313e6c4eb7f80cf856167be8e37f", "ja": "えっと、そのお料理は……\n『アボカドとオマール海老のミニサラダ』ね。", "zh": "那个，这道料理是……\n“牛油果和龙虾迷你沙拉”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "5923a1807080c2e1178e5106ea5e824b9cc26ed1a49b04d3731eecc6ed372098", "ja": "その隣にあるのが、『パテ・ド・カンパーニュ』。\n赤ワインに合うお料理みたいね。ふふっ、美味しそう♪", "zh": "旁边那个是“乡村肉酱”。  \n看起来是很适合搭配红葡萄酒的料理呢。呵呵，好像很好吃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "eb7e9d112cf2147337bec694ba1e27a60c9232f9db25efa3b6a3cde145724f5c", "ja": "それじゃ食べながら、話を進めましょうか。\nあっ……その前に！　まずは乾杯よね！", "zh": "那我们边吃边聊吧。\n啊……不过在那之前！先干杯吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "78f0376f41e382909f0323e8e2eda9636426632e971e765c7ac6fcaceadd08a2", "ja": "みんなグラスを持って？　テレビの前のみんなもよ♪\n最後まで私たちと一緒に楽しみましょう！　せーの！", "zh": "大家拿好杯子哦？电视机前的大家也一起♪  \n让我们和大家一起开心到最后吧！预备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0170_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0170_story_01_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "a627558b633df21409b8b7119f86638c0f6a93bae5addb04924fcbc03b429590", "ja": "カンパ～イ♪", "zh": "乾～杯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
